# Generated reports, not evidence in themselves.
#
# Each is the deterministic output of a runner in this directory, rebuilt from
# the frozen inputs/ (which ARE tracked, because they cannot be regenerated --
# they came off the rig). Together they were ~10 MB of single-line JSON, and a
# regeneration rewrote the whole blob, so tracking them cost the repository far
# more than it bought. RESULTS.md carries the numbers that were read off them.
#
# Rebuild: see the "Run" section of README.md.
l2_report.json
l3_report.json
l3_report_*.json
